# An impl method that writes no effect row takes the trait method's row, so a
# pure caller may call it: a user trait's `-[]>` method and the CheckedText
# `check`/`encode_hole` pair (#6281 c11), and every tier prints the same.
fixture: impl_method_inherits_trait_effect_row_on_every_tier.fixture
